			(property "Description" "36V, 150mA, ultralow-noise (12.7uVrms), high-PSRR (72dB) adjustable POSITIVE linear regulator. Vout = VFB(nom)*(1+R1/R2), VFB(nom)=1.185V typ (TI datasheet SBVS121E Eq.5's own worked value); EN can tie directly to IN if unused (datasheet Sec.5, verbatim) but must not float (Sec.9.3 Do's and Don'ts). Packages: 8-pin HVSSOP PowerPAD (DGN, used here) or 3x3mm VSON (DRB, QFN-style -- excluded, this board's own hand-solderability constraint disallows QFN/BGA)."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
